sequenceDiagram
    participant D as Grove 22.8 driver
    participant R1 as Ravel 1.1.0 keg
    participant F as Finish in Claude Code
    participant N as Native plugin cache
    participant H as Real HOME settings
    participant R2 as Promoted Ravel 2.0.0
    participant P as Probe sessions
    D->>R1: Launch finish through policy.ts
    R1->>F: Start Claude Code with the mandate
    F->>N: Read grove-finish and the spine by absolute path
    F->>F: Release Grove and promote Ravel
    F->>F: Switch steps 1 to 3: list the processes, read the run record
    F->>H: Prelude while no run is open: settings record, then the off value, sources = []
    Note over H,R2: A 2.0 launch now delivers no keg source before the switch changes skills
    F->>H: Prelude: install the writing hooks plugin, each command under a held link
    F->>H: Disable it by the exchange, after a settings record
    Note over N: Each command names writing-hooks, so the frozen registration stays as it was
    F->>F: Admit the released keg's digests, then check the formula versions and every accepted digest
    F->>H: Switch: skills to its switched value, plugins, moved entries
    Note over N: Disabling writes no orphan marker, so finish's lazy reads still resolve
    F->>R2: Capture the keg sources
    R2->>P: Launch Claude Code and Codex with directories
    P-->>F: Observed reads and hook runs
    F->>R1: Original end-session command
    Note over D,R2: After the reap, new drivers use compatible Grove and Ravel 2.0.0
